Ian Darwin (darwin!ian) has improved the front-end of the ratfor
program recently posted to net.sources. It now uses getopt(), and
accepts a parameter (-l n) to set the ratfor-generated label number.
Here is a normal diff of this version, to feed into patch 1.3.

Oz

Ps: case stmt handling on its way..

